{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember the old firecracker hunting game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's back, more explosive than ever! Now with monsters, power-ups, and bosses. Level up, plan your strategy, and prove you're the fastest to clear the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Destroy enemies!!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your available HP to destroy as many monsters as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/e75d6ec52566cb070454732ef8da307f.poster.avif?t=1755875411\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/e75d6ec52566cb070454732ef8da307f.webm?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/e75d6ec52566cb070454732ef8da307f.mp4?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Collect XP and level up!!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather as much XP as you can to level up and defeat tougher enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/e8e0243a7e9246d00e5280ee0f65cc64.poster.avif?t=1755875411\" width=628 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/e8e0243a7e9246d00e5280ee0f65cc64.webm?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/e8e0243a7e9246d00e5280ee0f65cc64.mp4?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Collect power-ups!!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up health items, orbs, and other power-ups to go even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/957b568f02e672f8522020021f94cdec.poster.avif?t=1755875411\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/957b568f02e672f8522020021f94cdec.webm?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/957b568f02e672f8522020021f94cdec.mp4?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Climb to the top!!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't just about surviving \u2014 it's about being the fastest! Use your resources wisely, think fast, and clear the map before anyone else. Climb the leaderboard and prove you're the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/44f8202f37972876e2b6b944539bffbc.poster.avif?t=1755875411\" width=660 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/44f8202f37972876e2b6b944539bffbc.webm?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874510/extras/44f8202f37972876e2b6b944539bffbc.mp4?t=1755875411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874510?t=1755875411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb